sequenceDiagram
    actor Recruiter
    participant Desk
    participant API
    participant Source as Folder, Drive, or S3
    participant People

    Recruiter->>Desk: Paste a folder
    Desk->>API: Check
    API->>Source: List PDF, DOC, DOCX, TXT
    API-->>Desk: One newest file per person
    Recruiter->>Desk: Ingest
    Desk->>API: Start
    API->>Source: Read those files
    API->>People: Update that person in place
    API-->>Desk: Progress, then unparsed files
